    "Id": "chassisdef_berserker_BRZ-A3",
    "Name": "Berserker",
    "Details": "Designed to engage in close range brawls, the 100 ton Berserker debuted in 3056. A 400-rated XL Engine paired with MASC allows the BRZ-A3 to outrun almost any other heavy or assault grade Mech. An ER PPC and a pair of Large Pulse Lasers make up the Mech’s ranged armament while a colossal 10 ton Hatchet is lethal at close range. AMS and Guardian ECM keep the Mech safe as it closes in, while a head mounted Flamer adds to the Mechs intimidation factor.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Melee Actuators</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.18</color></b>",
